### affichage restaurants en fonction de params de recherche par ville
GET http://localhost:3000/rpc/get_restaurants?research=namur
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJyb2xlIjoiY2xpZW50Iiwic3ViIjoieGFwaWdlb2xldEBlcGZjLmV1IiwibmFtZSI6IlhhdmllciIsInVzZXJfaWQiOjMsImV4cCI6MTc3OTA1ODU0Nn0.0AmU8GCCuZ2ShcUTTOX1YLqPvpnkkYl4c2DWrv6bj4Y

